@choice.ready:I{ky=~15:candidate.ready;pr=@project;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];st=proposed;vl={alpha=~4:full;intent=~379:One static 16x16 Ready status image for later destination assets/ready.png (consumer path). Transparent background, no fixed palette, partial alpha permitted (brief: transparent backgrounds, fixed palette not required). Checkmark motif, chunky strokes, cool blue near #70b9ed with a lighter highlight and no backing plate are specialist sample choices, revisable at style review.;palette=[];sampling=~7:nearest;size=[16,16];view=~2:ui};wh=@actor;wy=~142:Concrete candidate interpretation for the reviewed scope; source requirements retain their original authority in the selected PLAR and packet.}
@contract.ready:C{al=full;ch=[@choice.ready];li=~379:One static 16x16 Ready status image for later destination assets/ready.png (consumer path). Transparent background, no fixed palette, partial alpha permitted (brief: transparent backgrounds, fixed palette not required). Checkmark motif, chunky strokes, cool blue near #70b9ed with a lighter highlight and no backing plate are specialist sample choices, revisable at style review.;nm=~24:Ready status icon sample;pl=[];px=[16,16];sa=nearest;vw=ui}
@criterion.ready.cool-blue-accent:Q{ck=~203:The dominant colour treatment visibly relates to the existing UI's cool blue accent as seen in assets/start.svg (#70b9ed). This is a visual relationship judgement, not an exact-hex or palette-count rule.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~16:cool-blue-accent;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];wh=@actor}
@criterion.ready.geometry:Q{ck=~104:Decoded image is exactly 16x16 pixels with a single static frame (no horizontal strip, no extra canvas).;dm=mechanical;md=local;nm=~8:geometry;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];wh=@actor}
@criterion.ready.readability-1x-3x:Q{ck=~142:Composited on #172336, the silhouette is readable at 1x and at 3x nearest-neighbor scale, with no essential detail lost into the panel colour.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~17:readability-1x-3x;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];wh=@actor}
@criterion.ready.ready-meaning:Q{ck=~127:Viewed alone, the image reads as successful completion (Ready) rather than activity, failure, pause, or the idle Start control.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~13:ready-meaning;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];wh=@actor}
@criterion.ready.sample-pixel-craft:Q{ck=~262:As a representative family sample, the image shows deliberate pixel-art construction: clean pixel clusters and edges, no noisy stray pixels, blur or downscaled-illustration artifacts, and a treatment that could plausibly be extended to Working, Retry and Paused.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~18:sample-pixel-craft;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];wh=@actor}
@criterion.ready.silhouette-without-color:Q{ck=~148:In a grayscale/desaturated view at 1x and 3x, the Ready mark still has a distinct identifiable shape (its meaning is carried by form, not only hue).;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~24:silhouette-without-color;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];wh=@actor}
@criterion.ready.transparent-background:Q{ck=~197:The background is transparent: pixels outside the subject have alpha 0 and no opaque matte, box or fringe fills the cell. Partial alpha on subject pixels is permitted; binary alpha is not required.;dm=mechanical;md=local;nm=~22:transparent-background;so=[@source.0,@source.1,@source.2,@source.3,@source.4,@source.5,@source.6,@source.7,@source.8,@source.9,@source.10];wh=@actor}
