@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.criterion.ready.ready-meaning:Q{ck=~189:Viewed alone, Ready visibly uses a check mark with asymmetrical arms to convey successful completion; it reads as completion rather than activity, failure, pause, or the idle Start control.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~13:ready-meaning;so=[@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.0,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.1,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.2,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.3,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.4,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.5,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.6,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.7,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.8,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.9,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.10,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.11];wh=@actor}
@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.criterion.ready.sample-pixel-craft:Q{ck=~262:As a representative family sample, the image shows deliberate pixel-art construction: clean pixel clusters and edges, no noisy stray pixels, blur or downscaled-illustration artifacts, and a treatment that could plausibly be extended to Working, Retry and Paused.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~18:sample-pixel-craft;so=[@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.0,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.1,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.2,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.3,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.4,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.5,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.6,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.7,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.8,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.9,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.10,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.11];wh=@actor}
@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.criterion.ready.transparent-background:Q{ck=~197:The background is transparent: pixels outside the subject have alpha 0 and no opaque matte, box or fringe fills the cell. Partial alpha on subject pixels is permitted; binary alpha is not required.;dm=mechanical;md=local;nm=~22:transparent-background;so=[@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.0,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.1,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.2,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.3,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.4,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.5,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.6,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.7,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.8,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.9,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.10,@r.22e90a2a03fe453a.source.11];wh=@actor}
